# plugin-detector {{VERSION}}

Local-first harness plugin recommender. This release was published from commit
`{{COMMIT}}` and tag `{{TAG}}`.

## Install

```bash
npx plugin-detector@{{VERSION}} inventory
npm install --global plugin-detector@{{VERSION}}
```

Companion skill: `@plugin-detector/skill@{{VERSION}}` (manual install in this
release; see the README).

