## Verification

- npm packages publish with provenance (`publishConfig.provenance` and
  `npm publish --provenance`).
- SHA-256 checksums for every packed tarball are attached to this release and
  listed in the release notes.
- The tag is signed by a maintainer. Verify locally with:

  ```bash
  git tag -v {{TAG}}
  sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS
  ```

