## Known limitations

- Codex and Cursor installation is recipe-only.
- The bundled registry snapshot is a reviewed release input; if this release
  notes a seed/placeholder, `recommend` returns `no-good-candidates` until a
  refresh is reviewed.
- Scores are editorial estimates, not calibrated probabilities.
